msgstr "Künnig Typen"

#: settings/filetypes/filetypesview.cpp:103
msgid ""
"Here you can see a hierarchical list of the file types which are known on "
"your system. Click on the '+' sign to expand a category, or the '-' sign to "
"collapse it. Select a file type (e.g. text/html for HTML files) to view/edit "
"the information for that file type using the controls on the right."
msgstr ""
"Disse Boomlist wiest de Dateitypen, de op dien Systeem künnig sünd. Klick "
"op't \"+\"-Teken, wenn Du en Indraag opklappen wullt, oder op't \"-\"-Teken,"
"wenn Du em wedder tomaken wullt. Rechterhand kannst Du de Informatschonen "
"för den utsöchten Dateityp (t.B. \"text/html\" för HTML-Dateien) ankieken "
"oder bewerken."

