"on it to choose a different icon."
msgstr ""
"Disse Knoop wiest dat Lüttbild, dat den utsöchten Dateityp tohöört. Klick "
"dor op, wenn Du en anner Lüttbild utsöken wullt."

#: settings/filetypes/filetypedetails.cpp:52
msgid "Filename Patterns"
msgstr "Dateimustern"

#: settings/filetypes/filetypedetails.cpp:65
msgid ""
"This box contains a list of patterns that can be used to identify files of "
"the selected type. For example, the pattern *.txt is associated with the "
"file type 'text/plain'; all files ending in '.txt' are recognized as plain "
"text files."
msgstr ""
"An de Mustern op disse List laat sik Dateien vun den utsöchten Typ kennen. "
"Dat Muster \"*.txt\" t.B. is den Typ \"text/plain\" toornt, also höört all "
"Dateien, de ehr Naam mit \".txt\" ophöört, den Typ \"text/plain\" to."

#: settings/filetypes/filetypedetails.cpp:76
msgid "Add a new pattern for the selected file type."
msgstr "En nieg Muster för den utsöchten Typ tofögen."

#: settings/filetypes/filetypedetails.cpp:84
msgid "Remove the selected filename pattern."
msgstr "Dat utsöchte Dateimuster wegmaken."

#: settings/filetypes/filetypedetails.cpp:86
#: settings/konqhtml/pluginopts.cpp:607
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beschrieven"

#: settings/filetypes/filetypedetails.cpp:97
msgid ""
"You can enter a short description for files of the selected file type (e.g. "
"'HTML Page'). This description will be used by applications like Konqueror "
"to display directory content."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst en kort Beschrieven för Dateien vun den utsöchten Typ ingeven (t."
"B. \"HTML-Siet\"). Disse Beschrieven warrt vun Programmen as Konqueror "
"bruukt, wenn se Ornerinholden wiesen wüllt."

#: settings/filetypes/filetypedetails.cpp:128
msgid "Ask whether to save to disk instead"
msgstr "Fragen, wat ansteed op Fastplatt sekert warrn schall"

#: settings/filetypes/filetypedetails.cpp:143
msgid ""
"Here you can configure what the Konqueror file manager will do when you "
"click on a file of this type. Konqueror can display the file in an embedded "
"viewer or start up a separate application. If set to 'Use settings for G "
"group', Konqueror will behave according to the settings of the group G this "
"type belongs to, for instance 'image' if the current file type is image/png."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du instellen, wat Konqueror as Dateipleger deit, wenn Du op en "
"Datei vun dissen Typ klickst. Konqueror kann de Datei mit en inbett Kieker "
"wiesen oder dor en anner Programm för starten. Wenn Du \"Instellen för XY-"
"Koppel bruken\" anmaakst, bruukt Konqueror de Instellen för den Koppel, den "
"de Typ tohöört, t.B. \"image\", wenn Du den Dateityp \"image/png\" utsöcht "
"hest."

