#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:198
msgid ""
"If you disable this, Konqueror will stop interpreting the <i>window.open()</"
"i> JavaScript command. This is useful if you regularly visit sites that make "
"extensive use of this command to pop up ad banners.<br /><br /><b>Note:</b> "
"Disabling this option might also break certain sites that require <i>window."
"open()</i> for proper operation. Use this feature carefully."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du dit utmaakst, föhrt Konqueror den JavaScript-Befehl <i>window.open()"
"</i> nich mehr ut. Dat is goot, wenn Du faken Sieden besöchst, de dor "
"Warvenfinstern mit opduken laat.<br /><br /><b>Beacht:</b> Dat Utmaken vun "
"disse Optschoon mag dat richtige Funkscheneren vun Sieden verhöden, för de "
"<i>window.open</i> nödig is. Bruuk de Optschoon mit Acht."

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:212
msgid "Resize window:"
msgstr "Finstergrött ännern:"

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:228
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window size."
msgstr "De Finstergrött vun Skripten ännern laten"

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:233 settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:271
#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:309 settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:350
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Övergahn"

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:234
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window size. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it changed the size but the actual window is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Versöök vun Skripten, de Finstergrött to ännern, eenfach övergahn. Na de "
"Siet warrt <i>meldt</i>, dat dat Finster ännert wöör, man dat Finster "
"blifft, as dat is."

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:241
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window size on their own by using <i>window.resizeBy"
"()</i> or <i>window.resizeTo()</i>. This option specifies the treatment of "
"such attempts."
msgstr ""
"En poor Nettsieden ännert sülven de Finstergrött mit de Befehlen <i>window."
"resizeBy()</i> un <i>window.resizeTo()</i>. Disse Optschoon leggt fast, wat "
"mit disse Versöök daan warrt."

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:250
msgid "Move window:"
msgstr "Finster verschuven:"

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:266
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window position."
msgstr "Finstern vun Skripten verschuven laten"

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:272
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window position. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it moved the window but the actual position is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Versöök vun Skripten, en Finster to verschuven, eenfach övergahn. Na de Siet "
"warrt <i>meldt</i>, dat dat Finster verschaven wöör, man dat Finster blifft, "
"woneem dat is."

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:279
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window position on their own by using <i>window."
"moveBy()</i> or <i>window.moveTo()</i>. This option specifies the treatment "
"of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"En poor Nettsieden verschuuvt sülven Finstern mit de Befehlen <i>window."
"moveBy()</i> un <i>window.moveTo()</i>. Disse Optschoon leggt fast, wat mit "
"disse Versöök daan warrt."

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:288
msgid "Focus window:"
msgstr "Finster aktiv maken:"

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:304
msgid "Allow scripts to focus the window."
msgstr "Finstern vun Skripten aktiv maken laten"

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:310
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to focus the window. The web page will <i>think</"
"i> it brought the focus to the window but the actual focus will remain "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Versöök vun Skripten, Finster to aktiveren, eenfach övergahn. Na de Siet "
"warrt <i>meldt</i>, dat dat Finster anmaakt wöör, man dat aktive Finster "
"blifft aktiv."

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:318
msgid ""
"Some websites set the focus to their browser window on their own by using "
"<i>window.focus()</i>. This usually leads to the window being moved to the "
"front interrupting whatever action the user was dedicated to at that time. "
"This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"En poor Nettsieden maakt ehr Nettkiekerfinster sülven mit den Befehl "
"<i>window.focus()</i> aktiv. Tomehrst kummt denn dat Finster na vörn un "
"ünnerbrickt den Bruker bi dat, wat he jüst bi weer to doon. Disse Optschoon "
"leggt fast, wat mit disse Versöök daan warrt."

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:329
msgid "Modify status bar text:"
msgstr "Text vun den Statusbalken ännern:"

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:345
msgid "Allow scripts to change the text of the status bar."
msgstr "Skripten dat Ännern vun den Text op den Statusbalken verlöven"

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:351
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the status bar text. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it changed the text but the actual text will remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Versöök vun Skripten, den Text op den Statusbalken to ännern, eenfach "
"övergahn. Na de Siet warrt <i>meldt</i>, dat de Text ännert wöör, man de "
"Text blifft, as he is."

#: settings/konqhtml/jspolicies.cpp:359
msgid ""
"Some websites change the status bar text by setting <i>window.status</i> or "
"<i>window.defaultStatus</i>, thus sometimes preventing displaying the real "
"URLs of hyperlinks. This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"En poor Nettsieden ännert den Text mit de Befehlen <i>window.status</i> un "
"<i>window.defaultStatus</i> sülven, wat dat Wiesen vun Links ehr "
"Teeladressen verhöden kunn. Disse Optschoon leggt fast, wat mit disse "
"Versöök daan warrt."

#: settings/konqhtml/main.cpp:66
msgid "kcmkonqhtml"
msgstr "kcmkonqhtml"

#: settings/konqhtml/main.cpp:66
msgid "Konqueror Browsing Control Module"
msgstr "Kuntrullmoduul för Konqueror as Nettkieker"

#: settings/konqhtml/main.cpp:68
msgid "(c) 1999 - 2001 The Konqueror Developers"
msgstr "(c) 1999-2001, De Schrieverslüüd vun Konqueror"

#: settings/konqhtml/main.cpp:72
msgid "Matthias Kalle Dalheimer"
msgstr "Matthias Kalle Dalheimer"

#: settings/konqhtml/main.cpp:75
msgid "Daniel Molkentin"
msgstr "Daniel Molkentin"

#: settings/konqhtml/main.cpp:78
msgid ""
"JavaScript access controls\n"
"Per-domain policies extensions"
msgstr ""
"JavaScript Togriepkuntrull\n"
"Verwiedern för Domään-Regeln"

#: settings/konqhtml/main.cpp:90
msgid "&Java"
msgstr "&Java"

#: settings/konqhtml/main.cpp:94
msgid "Java&Script"
msgstr "Java&Script"

#: settings/konqhtml/main.cpp:136
msgid ""
"<h2>JavaScript</h2>On this page, you can configure whether JavaScript "
"programs embedded in web pages should be allowed to be executed by Konqueror."
"<h2>Java</h2>On this page, you can configure whether Java applets embedded "
"in web pages should be allowed to be executed by Konqueror.<br /><br /"
"><b>Note:</b> Active content is always a security risk, which is why "
"Konqueror allows you to specify very fine-grained from which hosts you want "
"to execute Java and/or JavaScript programs."
msgstr ""
"<h2>JavaScript</h2>Op disse Siet kannst Du fastleggen, wat Konqueror na "
"Nettsieden inbett JavaScript-Programmen utföhren schall.<h2>Java</h2>Op "
"disse Siet kannst Du fastleggen, wat Konqueror na Nettsieden inbett Java-"
"Lüttprogrammen utföhren schall.<br /><br /><b>Beacht:</b> Dat is jümmers en "
"Sekerheitproblem, wenn Nettsieden Programmen op Dien Reekner sülven utföhren "
"dörvt. Dat is de Grund dorför, dat Du Konqueror bannig nau seggen kannst, "
"vun welke Reekners Du Java- / JavaScript-Programmen utföhren wullt."

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:57
msgid "Enable filters"
msgstr "Filtern anmaken"

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:60
msgid "Hide filtered images"
msgstr "Filtert Biller versteken"

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:63
msgid "URL Expressions to Filter"
msgstr "Adress-Utdrück, de filtert warrt"

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:71
msgid "Expression (e.g. http://www.site.com/ad/*):"
msgstr "Utdruck (t.B. http://www.siet.com/ad/*):"

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:80
msgid "Insert"
msgstr "Infögen"

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:82
msgid "Update"
msgstr "Opfrischen"

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:87
msgid "Import..."
msgstr "Importeren..."

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:89
msgid "Export..."
msgstr "Exporteren..."

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:99
msgid ""
"Enable or disable AdBlocK filters. When enabled a set of expressions to be "
"blocked should be defined in the filter list for blocking to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Warvenfiltern an- oder utmaken. Wenn anmaakt, schull en Reeg Adress-Utdrück "
"op de List stahn. Wenn en Utdruck op en Adress passt, warrt de Adress "
"utfiltert."

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:102
msgid ""
"When enabled blocked images will be removed from the page completely "
"otherwise a placeholder 'blocked' image will be used."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt blockeert Biller heel un deel vun de Siet wegmaakt, "
"anners warrt en Platzhollerbild \"Blockeert\" wiest."

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:104
msgid ""
"This is the list of URL filters that will be applied to all linked images "
"and frames. The filters are processed in order so place more generic filters "
"towards the top of the list."
msgstr ""
"Dit is de List vun Adress-Utdrück, de op all linkte Biller un Rahmens "
"utprobeert warrt. Se warrt vun baven na nerrn dörgahn, so dat mehr allgemeen "
"Filtern na baven höört."

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:107
msgid ""
"Enter an expression to filter. Expressions can be defined as either a "
"filename style wildcard e.g. http://www.site.com/ads* or as a full regular "
"expression by surrounding the string with '/' e.g.  //(ad|banner)\\./"
msgstr ""
"Giff en Adress-Utdruck as Filter in. Utdrück köönt twee Formen hebben: To'n "
"Eersten de vun en Dateinaam mit Platzholltekens, t.B. \"http://www.siet.com/"
"ads*\", un to'n Tweten de vun en heel reguleer Utdruck. Du muttst reguleer "
"Utdrück in Dwarsstreek \"/\" insluten, t.B. \"//(ad|banner)\\./\"."

#: settings/konqhtml/filteropts.cpp:335
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror AdBlocK</h1> Konqueror AdBlocK allows you to create a list of "
"filters that are checked against linked images and frames. URL's that match "
"are either discarded or replaced with a placeholder image. "
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror-Warvenfilter</h1> De Warvenfilter is en List vun Filter-"
"Utdrück, bi de probeert warrt, wat se op de Adressen vun linkte Biller un "
"Rahmens passt. Wenn en Utdruck passt, warrt de Adress övergahn oder en "
"Platzholler för ehr insett."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:38
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Fonts</h1>On this page, you can configure which fonts "
"Konqueror should use to display the web pages you view."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Schriftoorden</h1>Op disse Siet kannst Du de Schriftoorden fastleggen, "
"de Konqueror för't Wiesen vun Nettsieden bruken schall."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:52
msgid "Font Si&ze"
msgstr "Schrift&grött"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:56 settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:74
msgid "This is the relative font size Konqueror uses to display web sites."
msgstr "Mit disse relative Schriftgrött wiest Konqueror Nettsieden."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:59
msgid "M&inimum font size:"
msgstr "S&ietst Schriftgrött:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:64
msgid ""
"Konqueror will never display text smaller than this size,<br />overriding "
"any other settings"
msgstr ""
"Konqueror wiest Text nienich lütter as mit de hier angeven Grött,<br />liek "
"wat anner Instellen oder de Nettsiet seggt."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:69
msgid "&Medium font size:"
msgstr "&Middelgrote Schrift:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:78
msgid "S&tandard font:"
msgstr "S&tandardschriftoort:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:86
msgid "This is the font used to display normal text in a web page."
msgstr "Mit disse Schriftoort wiest Konqueror normaal Text op Nettsieden."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:93
msgid "&Fixed font:"
msgstr "&Fastbreed Schriftoort:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:101
msgid ""
"This is the font used to display fixed-width (i.e. non-proportional) text."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Schriftoort wiest Konqueror fastbreed (also nich-proportschonaal) "
"Text."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:108
msgid "S&erif font:"
msgstr "S&erifen-Schriftoort:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:116
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as serif."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Schriftoort stellt Konqueror Text dor, de Serifen hebben schall."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:123
msgid "Sa&ns serif font:"
msgstr "Schriftoort ahn Serifen:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:131
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as sans-serif."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Schriftoort stellt Konqueror Text dor, de keen Serifen hebben "
"schall."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:138
msgid "C&ursive font:"
msgstr "Kursiev Schriftoort:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:146
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as italic."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Schriftoort stellt Konqueror Text dor, de kursiev wesen schall."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:153
msgid "Fantas&y font:"
msgstr "Smu&ck-Schriftoort:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:161
msgid ""
"This is the font used to display text that is marked up as a fantasy font."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Schriftoort stellt Konqueror Text dor, de besünners smuck wesen "
"schall."

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:173
msgid "Font &size adjustment for this encoding:"
msgstr "Schriftgrött-T&opassen för disse Koderen:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:187
msgid "Default encoding:"
msgstr "Standardkoderen:"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:196 settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:367
msgid "Use Language Encoding"
msgstr "Koderen för de Spraak bruken"

#: settings/konqhtml/appearance.cpp:200
msgid ""
"Select the default encoding to be used; normally, you will be fine with 'Use "
"language encoding' and should not have to change this."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de Standardkoderen utsöken. Normalerwies schull \"Koderen för "
"de Spraak bruken\" funkscheneren; dat schull nich nödig wesen, dat Du dit "
"ännerst."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:47
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Browser</h1> Here you can configure Konqueror's browser "
"functionality. Please note that the file manager functionality has to be "
"configured using the \"File Manager\" configuration module. You can make "
"some settings how Konqueror should handle the HTML code in the web pages it "
"loads. It is usually not necessary to change anything here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror as Nettkieker</h1> Hier kannst Du Konqueror sien Bedregen as "
"Nettkieker instellen. Beacht bitte, dat Du em sien Bedregen as Dateipleger "
"mit dat Moduul \"Dateipleger\" instellt muttst. Du kannst en Reeg Instellen "
"fastleggen, wat Konqueror mit dat laadte HTML maken schall. Normalerwies "
"schull dat nich nödig wesen, dat Du hier wat ännerst."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:55
msgid "Boo&kmarks"
msgstr "&Leestekens"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:60
msgid "Ask for name and folder when adding bookmarks"
msgstr "Bi't Tofögen vun Leestekens na Naam un Orner fragen"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:63
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will allow you to change the title of the "
"bookmark and choose a folder in which to store it when you add a new "
"bookmark."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, fraagt Konqueror Di na den Titel vun dat Leesteken un na den "
"Orner, binnen den he dat wohren schall."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:69
msgid "Show only marked bookmarks in bookmark toolbar"
msgstr "Bloots markeert Leestekens op den Leestekenbalken wiesen"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:71
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will show only those bookmarks in the "
"bookmark toolbar which you have marked to do so in the bookmark editor."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaaktt, wiest Konqueror bloots de Leestekens op den Leestekenbalken, "
"för de Du dat binnen den Leestekeneditor so fastleggt hest."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:80
msgid "Form Com&pletion"
msgstr "Formulor-Kom&pletteren"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:85
msgid "Enable completion of &forms"
msgstr "&Formuloren automaatsch kompletteren"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:88
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will remember the data you enter in web "
"forms and suggest it in similar fields for all forms."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, markt sik Konqueror, wat Du in Formulorfeller ingeven hest. He "
"sleit dat denn in all Formuloren för lieke Feller vör."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:93
msgid "&Maximum completions:"
msgstr "&Hööchsttall vun Kompletteren:"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:97
msgid ""
"Here you can select how many values Konqueror will remember for a form field."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wo vele Indrääg sik Konqueror för en Formulorfeld "
"markt."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:106
msgid "Mouse Beha&vior"
msgstr "Muus&bedregen"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:110
msgid "Chan&ge cursor over links"
msgstr "Muuswieser över Links ä&nnern"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:112
msgid ""
"If this option is set, the shape of the cursor will change (usually to a "
"hand) if it is moved over a hyperlink."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt en anner Muuswieser (normalerwies en Hand) wiest, wenn "
"he över en Link steiht."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:116
msgid "M&iddle click opens URL in selection"
msgstr "M&iddelklick maakt utsöcht Adress op"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:119
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can open the URL in the selection by middle "
"clicking on a Konqueror view."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is un Du en Adress mit de Muus utsöcht hest, kannst Du ehr "
"opmaken, wenn Du eenfach mit den Middelmuusknoop binnen en Konquerorfinster "
"klickst."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:123
msgid "Right click goes &back in history"
msgstr "Rechtsklick geiht in de Vörgeschicht &torüch"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:126
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can go back in history by right clicking on a "
"Konqueror view. To access the context menu, press the right mouse button and "
"move."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, kannst Du eenfach een Siet torüch gahn, wenn Du mit den "
"rechten Muusknoop binnen en Konquerorfinster klickst. Wenn Du dat "
"Rechtsklickmenü bruken wullt, drück op den rechten Knoop vun de Muus un "
"beweeg ehr en beten."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:136
msgid "A&utomatically load images"
msgstr "Biller a&utomaatsch laden"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:137
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will automatically load any images that "
"are embedded in a web page. Otherwise, it will display placeholders for the "
"images, and you can then manually load the images by clicking on the image "
"button.<br />Unless you have a very slow network connection, you will "
"probably want to check this box to enhance your browsing experience."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, laadt Konqueror all Biller automaatsch, de in en Nettsiet "
"inbett sünd. Anners wiest he Platzhollers för de Biller. Du kannst se denn "
"vun Hand laden, wenn Du op den Bildknoop klickst.<br />Maak dit man an, wenn "
"Du nich en bannig langsame Nettwark-Verbinnen hest, dat verbetert sachtens "
"Dien Nett-Beleefnis."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:148
msgid "Dra&w frame around not completely loaded images"
msgstr "&Rahmen rund nich heel laadte Biller wiesen"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:149
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will draw a frame as placeholder around "
"not yet fully loaded images that are embedded in a web page.<br />Especially "
"if you have a slow network connection, you will probably want to check this "
"box to enhance your browsing experience."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, wiest Konqueror en Rahmen as Platzholler rund de Biller , de "
"noch nich heel laadt sünd.<br />Maak dit man an, wenn Du en bannig langsame "
"Verbinnen hest, dat verbetert sachtens Dien Nett-Beleefnis."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:157
msgid "Allow automatic delayed &reloading/redirecting"
msgstr "&Ophollen automaatsch Niegladen un Ümledden tolaten"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:158
msgid ""
"Some web pages request an automatic reload or redirection after a certain "
"period of time. By unchecking this box Konqueror will ignore these requests."
msgstr ""
"En Reeg Nettsieden wüllt sik na en fastleggt Tiet nieg laden oder gaht na en "
"anner Siet wieder. Wenn dit anmaakt is, lett Konqueror dat to, anners nich."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:166
msgid "Enable/disable Access Ke&y activation with Ctrl key"
msgstr "&Togrieptasten mit de Strg-Tast an-/utmaken"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:167
msgid ""
"Pressing the Ctrl key when viewing webpages activates KDE's Access Keys. "
"Unchecking this box will disable this accessibility feature. (Konqueror "
"needs to be restarted for changes to take effect)"
msgstr ""
"Dat Drücken vun de Strg-Tast bi't Nettkieken maakt KDE sien Togrieptasten "
"an. Maakst Du dit ut, warrt disse Hülpfunkschoon utmaakt (Du muttst "
"Konqueror nieg starten, ehr he disse Ännern övernimmt)."

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:178
msgid "Und&erline links:"
msgstr "Links ünn&erstreken:"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:182
msgctxt "underline"
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Anmaakt"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:183
msgctxt "underline"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Utmaakt"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:184
msgid "Only on Hover"
msgstr "Bloots bi't Anrögen"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:188
msgid ""
"Controls how Konqueror handles underlining hyperlinks:<br /"
"><ul><li><b>Enabled</b>: Always underline links</li><li><b>Disabled</b>: "
"Never underline links</li><li><b>Only on Hover</b>: Underline when the mouse "
"is moved over the link</li></ul><br /><i>Note: The site's CSS definitions "
"can override this value</i>"
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, wat Konqueror mit Links maakt:<br /><ul><li><b>Anmaakt</b>: "
"Links warrt jümmers ünnerstreken</li><li><b>Utmaakt</b>: Links warrt nienich "
"ünnerstreken</li><li><b>Bloots bi't Anrögen</b>: Bloots ünnerstreken, wenn "
"de Muus den Link anröögt</li></ul><br /><i>Beacht: De CSS-Stilvörlaag vun de "
"Siet kann disse Instellen överschrieven</i>"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:199
msgid "A&nimations:"
msgstr "A&nimeren:"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:203
msgctxt "animations"
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Anmaakt"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:204
msgctxt "animations"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Utmaakt"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:205
msgid "Show Only Once"
msgstr "Bloots eenmaal wiesen"

#: settings/konqhtml/htmlopts.cpp:209
msgid ""
"Controls how Konqueror shows animated images:<br /><ul><li><b>Enabled</b>: "
"Show all animations completely.</li><li><b>Disabled</b>: Never show "
"animations, show the start image only.</li><li><b>Show only once</b>: Show "
"all animations completely but do not repeat them.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, wat Konqueror mit animeert Biller maakt:<br /"
"><ul><li><b>Anmaakt</b>: All Animeren warrt wiest.</li><li><b>Utmaakt</b>: "
"Bloots dat eerste Bild vun de Animeren warrt wiest.</li><li><b>Bloots "
"eenmaal wiesen</b>: All Animeren warrt nau eenmaal wiest.</li></ul>"

#: settings/konqhtml/policydlg.cpp:42
