msgstr "JavaS&cript för't hele Systeem anmaken"

#: settings/konqhtml/jsopts.cpp:56
msgid ""
"Enables the execution of scripts written in ECMA-Script (also known as "
"JavaScript) that can be contained in HTML pages. Note that, as with any "
"browser, enabling scripting languages can be a security problem."
msgstr ""
"Lett dat Utföhren vun Skripten in ECMA-Script (ok \"JavaScript\" nöömt) to, "
"se sünd faken na HTML-Sieden inbett. Beacht bitte, dat dor (as bi all "
"Nettkiekers) Sekerheitproblemen bi rutkamen köönt, wenn Nettsieden op Dien "
"Reekner Skripten utföhren dörvt."

#: settings/konqhtml/jsopts.cpp:63
msgid "Report &errors"
msgstr "&Fehlers wiesen"

#: settings/konqhtml/jsopts.cpp:64
msgid ""
"Enables the reporting of errors that occur when JavaScript code is executed."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt Fehlers wiest, de bi't Utföhren vun JavaScript opdukt."

#: settings/konqhtml/jsopts.cpp:69
msgid "Enable debu&gger"
msgstr "&Fehlersöker anmaken"

#: settings/konqhtml/jsopts.cpp:70
